  <p class="standfirst">Brief Black Friday paid social after Friday, Oct. 30, and on the counting below it spends Black Friday still learning. Every date here comes from the same arithmetic: start from what the platforms, the carriers and the regulators publish, then count back to the day the brief has to land.</p>

  <h2>What does the 2026 holiday content calendar look like, counted backwards?</h2>

  <p>Black Friday is Nov. 27, 2026, but the last day to brief its paid social is Oct. 30, and a 20 to 50 SKU marketplace refresh needed briefing by Oct. 6. The dates below count back from published ad review times, Amazon's deal window and the USPS cutoffs, using the hubStudio studio's own published production windows.</p>

