  <blockquote class="evidence">Meta's feed image ads run 4:5 at 1440x1800. Reels ads run 9:16 at 1440x2560, with the top 14 percent, the bottom 35 percent and 6 percent on each side kept clear of text, logos and key elements.</blockquote>
  <p class="source">Source: Meta's Facebook Ads Guide, feed image and Reels video ad specifications, read Sept. 10, 2026, rechecked Sept. 15, 2026. Platform documentation.</p>

