  <p class="source">Source: TikTok Ads Help Center, auction in-feed specifications, updated June 2026; Amazon Seller Central, Product image guide, US store; both read Sept. 10, 2026.</p>

  <p>Email answers to no ad review queue, so it's the one family that can move late.</p>

